<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-censĕo</span></b> , ŭi,
		2, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to go through</i> or <i>over</i> a
			thing. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to count over</i>,
				<i>reckon up</i>, <i>enumerate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inveniendi locos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Part. 36, 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					33, 32</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 36,
			15</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numerum legionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res Caesaris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					7, 26, 27, § 99</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen., <i>to survey</i>, <i>view;</i> lit. and trop., <i>to review</i>, <i>examine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manipulos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 50, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					32, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">captivos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia vultu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					6, 648</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orationem acri subtilique ingenio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					7, 3, 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To go over</i>, <i>travel
			through</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thessaliam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					34, 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totum orbem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 335</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">signa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					3, 109</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
